%% NIZAM Write-Path Sequence (record → dedupe → dual-write → write-back → audit)
%% Source of truth: NIZAM__system/docs/NIZAM_ORCHESTRATION_LAYER.md §5 + §6.c
%% Realized in HIFZ__github_version_control/scripts/nizam_dual_write.py
%% dedupe_key formula: {Lane}:{Type}:{date}:{slug} (governor_runtime_record.schema.json)

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Agent (Scribe/Pulse/Witness/Almanac)
    participant S as Steward (Governor)
    participant N as Notion (Pulse/Witness)
    participant D as Drive (Records/)
    participant L as Audit Log
    participant Q as DeadLetter Queue
    participant O as Operator (stdout)

    A->>S: record + payload
    S->>S: normalize · compute dedupe_key<br/>{Lane}:{Type}:{date}:{slug}
    S->>N: query dedupe_key
    alt found
        N-->>S: existing page_id (UPDATE mode)
    else not found
        N-->>S: none (CREATE mode)
    end
    S->>D: check Drive path

    rect rgb(230,245,255)
        note over S,N: Primary write (retry ladder: 1s · 4s · 16s, max 3)
        S->>N: write row (CREATE or UPDATE)
        alt success
            N-->>S: page_id + url
        else transient failure
            S->>S: backoff(1s) · retry
            S->>S: backoff(4s) · retry
            S->>S: backoff(16s) · retry
            S-->>Q: still failing → enqueue, alert (NEVER drop)
        end
    end

    S->>D: write Drive doc (header: notion_page_id · dedupe_key · captured_at · repo_commit)
    D-->>S: drive_url
    S->>N: write-back DriveLink
    S->>L: append audit row (event_type · time · entity_id · payload_hash · outcome)

    alt all layers down (§5 last resort)
        S->>O: serialize FULL JSON bundle to stdout<br/>"§1.1 — operator saves by hand"
    end

    S-->>A: write-receipt JSON (§7-style)

    note over A,O: COMPLETE only when (a) record persisted, (b) audit row written, (c) pending queue reported.
